@startuml getOperationNameAsync
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
getOperationNameAsync – Retrieve Operation Name
end title

participant "requestor" as requestor
participant "Operation Server Interface" as osi #LightCyan
participant "JSON Driver" as jd #LightYellow
participant "config.json" as cfg #LightGrey

note over requestor
  - operationServerUuid
end note

requestor -> osi: (operationServerUuid)
activate osi

osi -> jd: read logical-termination-point
activate jd

jd <-> cfg: retrieve control-construct

jd --> osi: Operation Server List from LTP 
deactivate jd

note over osi
  <u>Processing</u>
  - Locate operation-server LTP with matching UUID  
  - Access operation-server-interface capability  
  - Read operation-name attribute  
  - Return operationName if found  
  - Return undefined if not present
end note

osi --> requestor: operationName | undefined
deactivate osi

@enduml
